ype="pmid">9408738</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back><floats-wrap><table-wrap id="tbl1" position="float"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p content-type="table-title">Sample characteristics at date of entry of 8736 persons in the third survey of the Copenhagen City Heart Study (1991&#x02013;2002), Denmark</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" border="1" width="85%"><colgroup><col align="left"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</th><th colspan="5" align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>No. of types of stressful life event experienced</bold></th></tr><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Characteristic</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>0</bold><break/><bold><italic>n</italic>&#x0003d;2349</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>1</bold><break/><bold><italic>n</italic>&#x0003d;2628</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>2</bold><break/><bold><italic>n</italic>&#x0003d;1783</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>&#x02a7e;3</bold><break/><bold><italic>n</italic>&#x0003d;1976</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold><italic>P</italic><sup>a</sup></bold></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Age in years (mean, s.d.)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">59.4 (16.2)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">58.3 (15.5)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">56.6 (15.1)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">54.5 (13.4)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x0003c;0.001</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Alcohol consumption in drinks per day (mean, s.d.)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.7 (0.9)</td><td align="center" valign=